plan_0:
- Monitor competitor's price fluctuations and adjust our own pricing accordingly;
  - Implement periodic promotions or discounts to attract customers and gain market share;
  - Maintain our competitive advantage by continuing to offer higher quality products at reasonable prices.

insight_0:
- Competitor occasionally lowers price to increase sales, especially in rounds of increased competition;
  - Our pricing strategy allows us to maintain a significant profit margin;
  - Further research and analysis is needed on the impact of promotions and discounts on customer behavior and market share.
